{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow — /roster. A coach or principal photographs a school's attendance register; a vision model extracts the class roster; the coach reviews and corrects the WHOLE list in one editable screen, then saves.",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. Registered via bot/scripts/setup/flow-configs.js → 'Roster'. Resulting Flow ID goes to ROSTER_FLOW_ID.",
    "2. Endpoint (data_api_version 3.0, encrypted): POST /api/flows/roster.",
    "3. Gated by isSchoolLeader() from observe-gate.js AND the presence of ROSTER_FLOW_ID. Unset = the command does not exist."
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "PHOTOS BEFORE CLASS, deliberately. Extraction takes ~8s per page and Meta kills a data_exchange at ~10s, so the upload submit returns instantly and extraction runs async while the coach taps through grade/section/teacher. The class picker exists to buy that latency. If extraction is still running when CLASS submits, the endpoint routes to WORKING instead of REVIEW.",
    "REVIEW is ONE screen, not a per-student fix loop. attendance-setup-flow's own header records why: the previous per-student design meant 'a 40-student class was 40 submissions to Meta and nobody ever finished one'. Flows have no repeater, table or inline-edit component.",
    "THE LIST IS READ IN A TextBody AND EDITED IN TextAreas. A TextArea has no height, rows or size property and no scrollbar affordance — Meta gives you one small well whatever you do, and a coach reading a 40-name class through it saw four names and thought that was the whole extraction (field test, 2026-08-30). So the whole numbered list is rendered ABOVE the boxes as a TextBody, which flows down the screen instead of scrolling inside a well; the boxes carry only the edit surface, and each one's helper-text says which slice of the class it holds.",
    "TextArea max-length is 600 characters and that is a hard cap, so the roster is chunked across SIX boxes (~3600 chars, roughly 100 students with father names). Four boxes overflowed a 60-student class in test. Unused boxes are hidden via visible bindings rather than removed, because screen structure is static once published.",
    "Each line is prefixed with its roll number, or with '?' when the register's roll number could not be read. '?' is deliberate: on 2026-08-30 three rolls hidden behind a drawing came back as 10/11/12 for children the page numbers 35/36/37, so an unreadable roll is now abstained on rather than inferred, and the coach is shown that we do not know it.",
    "routing_model must stay ACYCLIC. REVIEW -> FIX -> REVIEW would be a cycle and Meta rejects it — the second reason edit-in-place beats a fix loop.",
    "SCHOOL offers the coach's own schools in a Dropdown AND a search link, the same pair observe-visit-v2 uses (SELECT_SCHOOL + EmbeddedLink -> SEARCH_SCHOOL -> SCHOOL_RESULTS). The dropdown covers the median coach (7 schools); the search covers the long tail and anyone who cannot spot theirs in a 200-row list.",
    "THE COMPLETION PAYLOAD IS FLAT. The discriminators go straight into the `complete` payload, which is the shape observe-visit-v2, remark, training-msq and exam-checker all use and all of whose acks work. The first version nested them under an `extension_message_response` whose `properties` were declared `{}`; nothing arrived, flow-type-detector answered 'unknown', and the coach got the catch-all reply after a successful save.",
    "Dropdown chrome is Latin-only (the Urdu-script list-chrome defect): Meta's list/dropdown secondary text fails on Urdu script. Student names live in TextArea and TextBody, which are not list chrome."
  ],
  "version": "7.0",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "SCHOOL": [
      "PHOTOS",
      "SCHOOL_SEARCH"
    ],
    "SCHOOL_SEARCH": [
      "SCHOOL_RESULTS"
    ],
    "SCHOOL_RESULTS": [
      "PHOTOS"
    ],
    "PHOTOS": [
      "CLASS"
    ],
    "CLASS": [
      "REVIEW",
      "WORKING"
    ],
    "WORKING": [
      "REVIEW"
    ],
    "REVIEW": [
      "SAVED"
    ],
    "SAVED": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "SCHOOL",
      "title": "Pick the school",
      "data": {
        "schools": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "abc",
              "title": "IMSG (I-8/4)"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "school_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Which school are you at?"
              },
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "school_id",
                "label": "School",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.schools}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Next",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "SCHOOL",
                    "school_id": "${form.school_id}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "EmbeddedLink",
            "text": "Search for a school by name",
            "on-click-action": {
              "name": "navigate",
              "next": {
                "type": "screen",
                "name": "SCHOOL_SEARCH"
              },
              "payload": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SCHOOL_SEARCH",
      "title": "Find a school",
      "data": {},
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "Type part of the school's name."
          },
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "school_search_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "term",
                "label": "School name",
                "required": false
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Search",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "SCHOOL_SEARCH",
                    "term": "${form.term}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SCHOOL_RESULTS",
      "title": "Matching schools",
      "data": {
        "schools": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "abc",
              "title": "IMSG (I-8/4)"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "school_results_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "school_id",
                "label": "School",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.schools}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Next",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "SCHOOL_RESULTS",
                    "school_id": "${form.school_id}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "PHOTOS",
      "title": "Photograph the register",
      "data": {
        "school_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "IMSG (I-8/4)"
        },
        "hint": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "One photo per register page. Get the whole name column in frame."
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "photos_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.school_name}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.hint}"
              },
              {
                "type": "PhotoPicker",
                "name": "pages",
                "label": "Register pages",
                "description": "Take a photo of each page, or pick from your gallery.",
                "photo-source": "camera_gallery",
                "min-uploaded-photos": 1,
                "max-uploaded-photos": 10,
                "max-file-size-kb": 10240
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Read the register",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "PHOTOS",
                    "pages": "${form.pages}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CLASS",
      "title": "Which class?",
      "data": {
        "grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "grade_3",
              "title": "Grade 3"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sections": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "A",
              "title": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        "caption": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Reading the register while you do this."
        },
        "teachers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "none",
              "title": "Not listed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "class_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Which class is this?"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.caption}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "grade_code",
                "label": "Grade",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.grades}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "section",
                "label": "Section",
                "data-source": "${data.sections}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "teacher_user_id",
                "label": "Class teacher",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.teachers}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "See the students",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "CLASS",
                    "grade_code": "${form.grade_code}",
                    "section": "${form.section}",
                    "teacher_user_id": "${form.teacher_user_id}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "WORKING",
      "title": "Still reading",
      "data": {
        "message": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Still reading the register — give it a few more seconds."
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "working_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Almost there"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.message}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Check again",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "WORKING"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "REVIEW",
      "title": "Check the students",
      "terminal": false,
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "41 students found"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 3-A. Fix any name that is wrong, then save."
        },
        "roster_text": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "1. Ayesha Bilal / Bilal Ahmed\n2. Fatima Noor / Noor Muhammad"
        },
        "chunk1": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "1. Ayesha Bilal"
        },
        "label1": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 1-15"
        },
        "help1": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 1-15 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "chunk2": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        },
        "label2": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 16-30"
        },
        "help2": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 16-30 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "show2": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": false
        },
        "chunk3": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        },
        "label3": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 31-45"
        },
        "help3": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 31-45 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "show3": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": false
        },
        "chunk4": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        },
        "label4": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 46-60"
        },
        "help4": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 46-60 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "show4": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": false
        },
        "chunk5": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        },
        "label5": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 61-75"
        },
        "help5": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 61-75 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "show5": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": false
        },
        "chunk6": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        },
        "label6": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 76-90"
        },
        "help6": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Students 76-90 of 41. One per line."
        },
        "show6": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": false
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "review_form",
            "init-values": {
              "chunk1": "${data.chunk1}",
              "chunk2": "${data.chunk2}",
              "chunk3": "${data.chunk3}",
              "chunk4": "${data.chunk4}",
              "chunk5": "${data.chunk5}",
              "chunk6": "${data.chunk6}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.roster_text}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk1",
                "label": "${data.label1}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help1}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk2",
                "label": "${data.label2}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help2}",
                "visible": "${data.show2}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk3",
                "label": "${data.label3}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help3}",
                "visible": "${data.show3}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk4",
                "label": "${data.label4}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help4}",
                "visible": "${data.show4}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk5",
                "label": "${data.label5}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help5}",
                "visible": "${data.show5}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "chunk6",
                "label": "${data.label6}",
                "helper-text": "${data.help6}",
                "visible": "${data.show6}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Save the roster",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "REVIEW",
                    "chunk1": "${form.chunk1}",
                    "chunk2": "${form.chunk2}",
                    "chunk3": "${form.chunk3}",
                    "chunk4": "${form.chunk4}",
                    "chunk5": "${form.chunk5}",
                    "chunk6": "${form.chunk6}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SAVED",
      "title": "Saved",
      "terminal": true,
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 3-A saved"
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "41 students are on the roster."
        },
        "roster_action": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "saved"
        },
        "roster_class": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 3-A"
        },
        "roster_count": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "41"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "saved_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.body}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Done",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "complete",
                  "payload": {
                    "roster_action": "${data.roster_action}",
                    "roster_class": "${data.roster_class}",
                    "roster_count": "${data.roster_count}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
